242
00:13:54,680 --> 00:13:56,357
Look, I can do this on my own.

243
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:58,120
Well, excuse me.

244
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:00,317
I was only trying to help
you win so you wouldn't

245
00:14:00,400 --> 00:14:02,257
have to miss out on
the Battle City Finals,

246
00:14:02,340 --> 00:14:03,170
Mrs.

247
00:14:03,253 --> 00:14:04,083
Grumpenheimer.

248
00:14:04,166 --> 00:14:07,681
Just keep your big mouth zipped or
I'll stick your dual disc in it.

249
00:14:08,200 --> 00:14:11,197
She's got to get rid of
those other three ninjas now.

250
00:14:11,280 --> 00:14:14,357
One more direct attack and
her life points are history.

251
00:14:14,440 --> 00:14:16,780
Then it's goodbye Battle City Finals.

252
00:14:17,020 --> 00:14:19,080
And hello, Mrs. Magnum.

253
00:14:19,300 --> 00:14:20,829
We're all behind you, Mai.

254
00:14:21,200 --> 00:14:22,740
I get the point.

255
00:14:23,260 --> 00:14:25,380
Then do like the Mai I know. Huh?

256
00:14:26,440 --> 00:14:27,757
All right, no more Mrs.

257
00:14:27,840 --> 00:14:28,670
Nice-My.

258
00:14:28,753 --> 00:14:29,840
Watch out, Jean.

259
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:31,180
I'm back.

260
00:14:31,420 --> 00:14:33,260
I play a magic card.

261
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,860
Elegant Egotist.

262
00:14:37,020 --> 00:14:38,980
It turns one harpy into three.

263
00:14:39,380 --> 00:14:40,960
Take out his ninjas.

264
00:14:50,700 --> 00:14:52,660
You're starting to bug me, kid.

265
00:14:53,200 --> 00:14:55,880
You talking to me, ninja nerd?

266
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:59,817
Why don't you leave this duel to
the grown-ups, you little twerp?

267
00:14:59,900 --> 00:15:04,417
Don't push me, Claude, or I'll show you
a few ninja moves of my own, you big ape.

268
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:05,330
Huh?

269
00:15:07,740 --> 00:15:08,570
What?

270
00:15:08,653 --> 00:15:10,044
I'd do the same for any of you.

271
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:13,682
That whole tough guy
routine is really cute, kid.

272
00:15:14,080 --> 00:15:16,300
But Mai's a big girl now, Jimmy.

273
00:15:16,660 --> 00:15:19,817
She doesn't need the whole
play group looking out for her.

274
00:15:19,900 --> 00:15:21,937
Look, pal, the name's Joey.

275
00:15:22,020 --> 00:15:23,737
And after that remark of yours,

276
00:15:23,820 --> 00:15:27,557
you can consider my membership in the
Jean-Claude Magnum fan club canceled,

277
00:15:27,640 --> 00:15:28,470
you fraud.

278
00:15:28,553 --> 00:15:30,480
Well, I'll survive somehow.

279
00:15:30,720 --> 00:15:34,249
But the money and fame just
won't feel the same without you.

280
00:15:34,960 --> 00:15:38,300
If you two are done, I'm
placing one card face down.

281
00:15:38,520 --> 00:15:39,820
It's about time.

282
00:15:40,620 --> 00:15:41,480
That's right.

283
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:47,660
You remember my ninja girl, don't you?

284
00:15:49,000 --> 00:15:49,830
Ha!

285
00:15:50,520 --> 00:15:51,350
Ah!

286
00:15:51,433 --> 00:15:56,440
Once I sacrifice her, my Ninja Master will
finish you off for good! Aw, no! Aw, yes!

287
00:15:56,840 --> 00:15:57,670
Sorry,

288
00:15:57,753 --> 00:16:02,197
but I'm about to cut your Ninja Girl from
the scene with my Grave Arm Magic Card!

289
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:04,868
It sends her directly
to the card graveyard!

290
00:16:07,980 --> 00:16:08,880
No way!

291
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:11,340
You've got no monsters to sacrifice!

292
00:16:11,700 --> 00:16:13,220
But wait, there's more!

293
00:16:14,140 --> 00:16:16,677
You forgot one very important thing!

294
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:20,417
That kite up there may protect your
ninja master from being attacked,

295
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:23,257
but it also takes your
monster out of all the action,

296
00:16:23,340 --> 00:16:25,516
including defending your life points.

297
00:16:25,900 --> 00:16:29,360
Which means that you're wide
open for a direct attack.

298
00:16:29,680 --> 00:16:31,957
So you can cancel those
wedding plans because

299
00:16:32,040 --> 00:16:35,180
I'll be busy at the Battle City Finals.

300
00:16:36,380 --> 00:16:40,180
Now, Cyber Harpies, finish
off this washed-up has-been.

301
00:16:40,760 --> 00:16:44,525
Attack his life points directly
with your triple scratch attack.

302
00:16:48,520 --> 00:16:49,600
The show's over.

303
00:16:50,960 --> 00:16:53,780
I give you two thumbs down, movie boy.

304
00:16:54,020 --> 00:16:56,844
I hope you've learned I'm
not a prize to be won.

305
00:16:59,620 --> 00:17:01,326
I think I'm missing the joke.

306
00:17:01,420 --> 00:17:02,538
It's not you, Joey.

307
00:17:02,640 --> 00:17:03,600
He's lost it.

308
00:17:04,220 --> 00:17:05,857
Oh, there's a joke, all right.

309
00:17:05,940 --> 00:17:09,057
And if you're missing it, that's
probably because the joke's on you.

310
00:17:09,140 --> 00:17:11,022
Please stop reciting your lines.

311
00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:12,077
The duel's over.

312
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,940
Get out of my life now. Huh?

313
00:17:14,080 --> 00:17:15,417
Your monster's still there?

314
00:17:15,500 --> 00:17:16,980
But the duel's over.

315
00:17:17,140 --> 00:17:19,537
All the dueling holograms
should have disappeared.

316
00:17:19,620 --> 00:17:22,149
Hey, guys, I don't
think that's a hologram.

317
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:26,144
That flying ninja's closing in.

318
00:17:26,260 --> 00:17:30,789
Welcome to the world of Hollywood special
effects, where anything can happen.

319
00:17:33,780 --> 00:17:36,540
Let me out, you sore loser. My!

320
00:17:37,180 --> 00:17:41,240
If I can't win your heart, my, then
I'm just gonna have to steal it.

321
00:17:42,200 --> 00:17:43,637
You won't get away with this.

322
00:17:43,720 --> 00:17:44,550
Come back, Joey.

323
00:17:44,633 --> 00:17:45,920
Let me go!

324
00:17:51,540 --> 00:17:52,560
Nice work!

325
00:17:52,760 --> 00:17:54,231
Now get her down quickly!

326
00:17:55,500 --> 00:17:56,940
Hang on, Mai!

327
00:17:57,960 --> 00:18:00,917
Put me down now, you ninja freak!

328
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:01,941
Mai, be careful!

329
00:18:03,180 --> 00:18:04,010
Mai!

330
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:08,740
Hang on!

331
00:18:09,060 --> 00:18:10,100
I'm coming!

332
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:14,200
She needs help, but I've
got no idea what to do!

333
00:18:16,520 --> 00:18:19,700
Hey, Mai, come on, let go!

334
00:18:20,020 --> 00:18:22,840
Are you nuts? No way! Do it!

335
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:24,760
I swear, I'll catch you!

336
00:18:27,500 --> 00:18:28,330
That's it!

337
00:18:32,300 --> 00:18:34,380
Oh, no, Joey, are you all right?

338
00:18:35,340 --> 00:18:37,140
Hey, here, take my hand, Mai.

339
00:18:37,480 --> 00:18:38,500
You're safe now.

340
00:18:39,500 --> 00:18:40,330
Get lost.

341
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:43,257
You don't even do your
own stunts, you coward.

342
00:18:43,340 --> 00:18:46,281
So does this mean our
wedding plans are off, dear?

343
00:18:46,480 --> 00:18:49,774
You're nothing but a cheap
Hollywood phony, Jean-Claude.

344
00:18:49,940 --> 00:18:53,640
The only real action hero around
here is right there, resting.

345
00:18:57,220 --> 00:18:58,100
I'm a fraud.

346
00:18:58,520 --> 00:18:59,500
It's the truth.

347
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:01,780
Hey, Joey! Bye!

348
00:19:02,140 --> 00:19:03,480
You're the best, Joey.

349
00:19:03,900 --> 00:19:06,237
But you could have married a movie star.

350
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:10,017
If I did that, I wouldn't be able to
kick your butt in the finals, would I?

351
00:19:10,100 --> 00:19:13,982
Plus, if you ever did get married,
you'd drive your husband crazy.

352
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:18,838
Are you going to be all right, Joey?

353
00:19:20,540 --> 00:19:21,440
Of course.

354
00:19:21,600 --> 00:19:22,897
I've never been better.

355
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:26,917
Now let's get inside that stadium
and do what we all came here to do.

356
00:19:27,000 --> 00:19:27,830
Yeah!

357
00:19:28,880 --> 00:19:31,520
The Battle City Finals start tonight.

358
00:19:31,820 --> 00:19:33,060
May the best man win.

359
00:19:33,300 --> 00:19:34,440
You mean woman.
